# SimpleOS production status ledger — canonical owner + maturity per subsystem.
# Master plan: doc/01_research/domain/simpleos_production_host_master_plan.md §22 Phase 0.
# Guarded by test/01_unit/os/arch/duplicate_owner_spec.spl (ledger/code parity).
# maturity: production | partial | model | evidence-only | host-proxy | stub | duplicate
# Progress notes reflect landed+pushed convergence tranches (2026-07-27):
#   Stage S/P/INT, T2 (container/DeviceGrant/flock), T3-T4 (Podman-MDSOC+ mgr+OCI),
#   FV/FV2 (Lean proofs), SVC (service_v1), UPD (TUF), SQ (SQLite-VFS contract).

production_status:
  abi_contract:
    owner: os.kernel.abi.abi_v1
    lane: A00
    maturity: partial
    note: ABI v1 frozen by reference (Stage S); duplicate-owner guard green
  kernel_types:
    owner: os.kernel.types
    lane: A00
    maturity: production
  ipc:
    owner: os.kernel.ipc
    lane: A01
    maturity: partial
    note: single-use capability guard landed + Lean-proven (SingleUse); l4_fast_ipc marked honest model; reply object landed as MODEL only (reply_object.spl — one-shot reply cap reusing SingleUseLedger, call/notify distinction, caller-death invalidation, atomic deny-wins handle transfer via spawn_with_cspace_tracked; spec reply_object_spec.spl); NOT wired to syscall_ipc and NOT on any boot path; full endpoint/reply/notification fastpath + two-process QEMU call/reply evidence still OUTSTANDING (gate in .spipe/ipc_reply_object/state.md)
  capability_spawn:
    owner: os.kernel.ipc.cspace_spawn
    lane: A02
    maturity: model
    note: root-only ambient-spawn guard wired (3/3 sites); SpawnSpec MIGRATION LANDED — spawn_recipes.spl declares least-authority (READ|EXEC only, narrow path prefix) recipes for the 3 real userland spawn callers (shell exec.spl, riscv32/64 console launch, launcher_registry app launch) and all 3 syscall_process gates + the fs-exec bridge now mint through spawn_with_cspace instead of spawn_full when a recipe is declared; WM confirmed NOT a spawn caller (ECS entity spawn only), sshd out of lane scope; boot seal STILL GATED OFF (_seal_ambient_spawn_on_boot -> false, init_services.spl untouched); REMAINING TO ARM = (1) wire spawn_recipe_seed_parent_caps into boot — an ambient full() parent holds ZERO concrete tokens so cspace_spawn._find_source rejects every recipe grant and mints deny-all without it, (2) the one-line flag flip, (3) real-firmware QEMU boot+launch transcript showing a post-seal recipe spawn succeeding and an unmigrated ambient spawn denied; sealed-behaviour proof (no flag flip) = test/01_unit/os/kernel/loader/spawn_seal_readiness_spec.spl; resume plan .spipe/boot_seal_prep/state.md; live child CSpace injection + ring-3 recipe syscall argument still pending; P8xP2 profile meet-point landed (spawn_effective_rights_with_profile, contract spec 16 examples 0 failures)
